It's a new experience.

334
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:48,060
(Boosted by a new experience)

335
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,320
It looks so ugly.

336
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,420
(As long as it tastes good)

337
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,680
I'll crack the egg.

338
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,640
I only want one crepe.

339
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,480
One crepe? Okay.

340
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,000
Yeah.

341
