Make it bloom like a little flower.

346
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,160
Got it.

347
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,280
Here, have a drink and talk less?

348
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,080
It's okay.

349
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,320
