I'll finish soon.

350
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,240
That's it. Remember?

351
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:17,480
Okay.

352
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,320
(Gladly agrees)
I remember.

353
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,120
I have to.

354
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,400
Carving flowers is no problem.

355
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:20,600
Yeah.

356
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,160
