359
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,040
If you're good enough.

360
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,760
Whatever you do, you'll do it well.

361
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:31,240
Do it well.

362
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,080
(Redefining a tongue twister)
Do it well.

363
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,440
We forgot to add oil earlier.

364
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,200
He doesn't want oil.

365
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,240
We...

366
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,280
we got one step wrong, He.

367
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,360
(Completely reversed)
Who puts the sausage on the outside?

368
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,560
Actually, it should be...

369
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,640
The chili and other ingredients

370
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,080
