373
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,680
How do we eat this?

374
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:55,960
Wait.

375
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,680
The sausage.

376
00:09:57,580 --> 00:09:59,820
(The flower-carved sausage)

377
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:01,320
Try our masterpiece.

378
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,400
I'll try the sausage first.

379
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:04,740
(Not confident)

380
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,960
(Not bad)
It's okay.

381
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,720
Really?

382
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:08,660
(Let me try too)

383
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:10,780
(How is it?)

384
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,520
It's alright.

385
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:14,400
We forgot to brush on the sauce.

386
00:10:14,540 --> 00:10:15,460
(Still has room to improve)

387
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,120
(Highly recommended)
Do you want to try the one they made?

388
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:18,960
The spicy one, right?

389
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,720
Yeah, that spicy one is really good.

390
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,560
How about this?

391
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:23,360
