We can each try what you made.

392
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:23,600
How about it?

393
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,360
We've already tried it.

394
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,240
We ate it as soon as it was ready.

395
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,560
