397
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,560
Let's try the spicy ones. Come on.

398
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,320
The three of us can split it.

399
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,120
Don't waste food. Come on.

400
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:38,780
