425
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:19,440
Help with what?

426
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,160
No need. He's got it.

427
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:20,720
He's doing it right.

428
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,000
