No, no rush.

438
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,040
Wait a bit. No rush.

439
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,640
The egg is fine.

440
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,680
The next memory room
has finished rendering.

441
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,960
All players, please return to the pod.

442
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:45,280
You'll be transported
to the next memory space.

443
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:47,080
(Only thinking about food)
His egg isn't done rendering yet.

444
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,320
The heat is a little slow.

445
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:48,960
It's okay.

446
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,480
