You can go after your egg is ready.

447
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,080
Go where?

448
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,680
To the next memory room.

449
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,000
His egg still isn't ready, right?

450
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,640
