455
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:04,680
It's not stuck.

456
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,180
(Smooth)

457
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:11,560
But it might be stuck to the mold.

458
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:11,880
Yeah.

459
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:12,880
(Definitely)

460
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,400
Because the mold
wasn't sprayed with oil.

461
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,920
(Asking Ning for help)
What should I do? Ning, help me.

462
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:19,200
Come on.

463
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:20,840
(Kind-hearted)
There's no other way.

464
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,760
It's just here.

465
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,480
Just wait.

466
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:22,920
We can only wait.

467
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,080
Only time can fix it.

468
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:24,880
Then get a...

469
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:25,200
Get a...

470
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,800
Get chopsticks and stir it around.

471
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,680
Give me chopsticks.

472
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,680
Stir it a little.

473
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,880
Yeah, use the other side.

474
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,240
Looks like it's almost there.

475
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,760
It's okay. Just wait.

476
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,400
Stir it a little.

477
00:12:38,300 --> 00:12:41,500
