478
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,300
(Effortlessly done)

479
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:45,760
Turning into scrambled eggs.

480
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:46,360
It's the same.

481
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:46,680
After it...

482
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,120
Once it sets again,

483
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,880
