484
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:51,400
But you need to flip it.

485
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:55,000
That's why you flip scrambled eggs.

486
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,120
It works faster.

487
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,920
It'll reshape itself.

488
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,160
It smells so good.

489
00:13:00,220 --> 00:13:01,540
