494
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,920
Come on, let's finish it.

495
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:17,320
Let's eat it.

496
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,000
Let's split it.

497
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,240
Everyone takes a bite.

498
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,080
Try this.

499
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:20,920
Here, one for you, one for me.

500
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:22,280
(I'll try it)

501
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:22,480
How is it?

502
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,400
A little bland.

503
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,000
Yeah, a little bland.

504
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,720
Right?

505
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:25,360
That's what we said.

506
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,000
Usually, with this much,

507
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,240
