to add a spoonful of salt.

508
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,080
Right.

509
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,240
It's okay. The egg itself is good.

510
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,480
(Eat it while it's hot)
You're gonna burn yourself, Ke.

511
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:33,620
(Hot)

512
