Do you want to add some sauce?

513
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,120
The sauce will make it too salty.

514
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,600
(Delicious)
It's fragrant. No need to add any.

515
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,560
