516
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,480
You just like stronger flavors.

517
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,440
You think it's just right, right?

518
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,120
I think it's okay.

519
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,800
It already has a little salty taste.

520
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:47,480
Alright.

521
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,280
Guys,

522
00:13:48,280 --> 00:13:49,200
