It's really good. Try some.

523
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:49,960
Everyone, eat this.

524
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:51,720
(I want a bite too)

525
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,080
Everyone, we're about to leave.

526
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:53,360
Okay.

527
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:55,660
(Take a quick bite)

528
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:58,220
