Let him. Come on.

532
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:04,720
♪I don't have time to shout out loud♪

533
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:05,880
(Jumping with the girls)
You all know it, right?

534
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:06,840
You all know it, right?

535
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:07,320
Okay.

536
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,520
Alright, everyone.

537
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,480
Let's put on a show for Mom and Dad.

538
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,440
