♪I don't have time to shout out loud♪

545
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,400
Alright, let's perform for Mom and Dad.

546
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,640
That's great!

547
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,640
You know it, right?

548
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:26,480
I really don't.

549
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,840
I only know this one move.

550
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,080
Okay.

551
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:30,960
Then let's perform for them together.

552
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,080
