911
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:18,520
A kid's voice said,

912
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,080
(Listen closely)
"Mom,"

913
00:24:20,080 --> 00:24:22,280
"come find me."

914
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,160
Then she suddenly yelled,

915
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:24,320
"You're not my mom."

916
00:24:24,320 --> 00:24:25,200
"You're not my mom!"

917
00:24:25,280 --> 00:24:26,760
(Outsmarting the crew)
We need to hint to each other.

918
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:28,320
(Bad ideas loading)
We should play a little dirty.

919
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:30,120
I'll say black magic.

920
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,800
What about blue? Blue is like this.

921
00:24:31,800 --> 00:24:32,760
(Give it a try)

922
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:33,320
Blue.

923
00:24:33,320 --> 00:24:34,680
(Practice pays off))
Practice and do some drills.

924
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:36,160
(Quiz addiction)
Ask one more.

925
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,320
How often does he shower?

926
00:24:37,320 --> 00:24:38,360
(In unison)
Never.

927
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:40,160
Outsmarting the crew is the whole show.

928
00:24:40,520 --> 00:24:42,960
I can know your pick without looking.

929
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:44,160
(Great teamwork)
He has superpowers.

930
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:44,800
I have superpowers.

931
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:45,480
Really?

932
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:47,560
(Rehearsal. A singer's high standards)
What if I only know the first line?

933
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:48,800
Don't be so strict.

934
00:24:48,840 --> 00:24:51,280
This is precise control over music.

935
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:52,760
I'm recreating it.

936
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:52,960
Okay?

937
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:53,880
Okay, guys.

